    "detailed_description": "Nerdtastic Norman is on the adventure for his life! Struck by a car while on his way to buy flowers for his girlfriend, Norman ends up in purgatory, where he must face challenges on all 7 terraces to regain fragments of his shattered soul, defeat the keepers of the gate, and return back to the land of the living. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nNerdtastic Norman is a 2d Adventure, Puzzle platformer, where players try to solve puzzles and fend off enemies to find soul fragments. Over 70 Unique levels and dangerous boss battles in this side scrolling 2d adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNorman's life is in your hands!",
    "about_the_game": "Nerdtastic Norman is on the adventure for his life! Struck by a car while on his way to buy flowers for his girlfriend, Norman ends up in purgatory, where he must face challenges on all 7 terraces to regain fragments of his shattered soul, defeat the keepers of the gate, and return back to the land of the living. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nNerdtastic Norman is a 2d Adventure, Puzzle platformer, where players try to solve puzzles and fend off enemies to find soul fragments. Over 70 Unique levels and dangerous boss battles in this side scrolling 2d adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNorman's life is in your hands!",
    "short_description": "Nerdtastic Norman is a 2d scrolling puzzle platformer set in purgatory based on Dante's Inferno. Over 70 unique levels, dangerously hard boss battles, and 1 unique story. Help Norman gather the missing pieces of his shattered soul, and help him return to the land of the living.",
